==Swedish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Sv-skit.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|/ˈɧiːt/|lang=sv}}

===Noun===
'''skit''' {{c}}

# {{context|strongly colloquial|lang=sv}} [[excrement]]; [[shit]]
#: ''Det är '''skit''' på mattan.'' "There's shit on the carpet."
# {{context|strongly colloquial|lang=sv}} dirt, filth
#: ''Ta bort den där '''skiten''' från skrivbordet.'' "Get that crap off the desk."
# {{context|strongly colloquial|lang=sv}} someone or something undesirable or revolting
#: ''Jag börjar tröttna på den här '''skiten'''.'' "I'm getting tired of this shit."
#: ''Du är bara en liten '''skit'''.'' "You're just a little shit."
# {{context|strongly colloquial|lang=sv}} prefix used to indicate something negative (used in compounds)
#: ''Det här är ett jävla '''skitjobb'''.'' "This is a damned crappy job."
# {{context|strongly colloquial|lang=sv}} intensifying prefix used in compounds (either negative or positive)
#: ''Den där filmen var '''skitbra'''.'' "That movie was really good."
#: ''De lagar '''skitgod''' mat.'' "They cook really good food."

===Interjection===
'''skit'''

# {{context|strongly colloquial|lang=sv}} [[shit]]!

